 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Viewer for comments stored beside source files
 Commentor shows comments stored outside source files and links them to
 the source lines they describe. The GUI pairs each source file with a
 .comments.d/<file>.cmt file, highlights bindings between source lines
 and comment blocks, and saves the edited comments back to disk.
 .
 This package contains the commentor GUI application.
